+     *   ignored (see comments for GetFontListShmBlock).
+     * @param aFamilyIndex
+     *   Index of the font family in the font list (see aAlias for which list).
+     * @param aAlias
+     *   Whether aFamilyIndex refers to the Families() or AliasFamilies() list.
+     * @param aFaceIndex
